My last pacifist failure was due to an unfortunate trickery death.
What can i say, i should have remembered to save my game when I
stopped playing. This was my next attempt. I started with a lawful
female monk.

Protection racket went smoothly as with oracle and sokoban got a BoH.
I found armor early on assisting with bump kills. I also found a
couple cream pies in minetown. A dragon in mines got me gray dragon
scale mail. Dipping a unicorn horn in potions gave me a magic whistle
from an unIDed polymorph potion. When food started getting scarce a
magic lamp I found and blessed gave me a wish for a ring of SD.  Some
polymorph traps gave me some rather buff pets. I used a cream pie on
my Balrogs face to take out medussa. I repeatedly cast sleep on her as
well. The castle was sacked fairly quickly except for the rooms
gaurded by a black dragon (no reflection). I burnt one wish on a
blessed figurine of archon and got a pet with reflection who took out
the Black Dragon for me. I burnt  all my other wishes too for
spellbooks, a wand of polymorph, the mitre of holiness etc. Total of 7
wishes this game.

The gate to hell went smoothly with my levels being beefed up to about
10. Unfortunately my archon got confused and killed all my other pets.
I gave him a unicorn horn before he got me as well.  Unfortunately
once in hell I fell down several levels and my archon became untame. I
guess I could have worn my levitation boots to avoid this.

After plinking around in the main dungeon for some time I got to XP 16
and was beginning to notice i was hitting monsters. I already had gone
through all my cream pies (2) and an expensive camera. I decided i
needed more cream pies. I tried to polymorph some food, with other
stuff, with no luck. Finally I found a shop with a living shopkeeper,
my pets had killed most. I stole from the shop and tried to lead my
pet dragon to the kops. unfortunately i bump killed a kop.

I climbed out of the dungeon in shame. Sure, I probably could have
easily ascended this character but damnit pacifist or bust.



